## For Media Buyers, Agencies & Brands

### OutMoove DSP
Broadsign's purpose-built DOOH demand-side platform. Delivers global inventory, transparency, and control for media buyers to plan, buy, and optimize data-driven programmatic DOOH campaigns.
URL: https://broadsign.com/outmoove/

### Audiences
Data-driven audience targeting for DOOH campaigns powered by mobile data (in partnership with Native Touch). Targets venues by 6 key audience groups and 190+ personas including age, income, gender, interests, life stage, and purchase intent.
URL: https://broadsign.com/audiences/

### Measurement & Attribution
Measurement solutions in partnership with industry-leading data providers. Includes brand lift studies, foot-traffic studies (store visit attribution), and web/app lift studies to link OOH exposure to real-world and digital results.
URL: https://broadsign.com/measurement-attribution/

### DSP Partners
Launch and manage programmatic DOOH campaigns from existing DSPs. Broadsign's SSP is integrated with 55+ DSPs worldwide for seamless omnichannel activation alongside existing digital campaigns.
URL: https://broadsign.com/dsp-partners/

### Inventory Catalog
Browse Broadsign's global network of digital screens across high-impact venue types including airports, billboards, grocery stores, malls, transit hubs, and urban panels.
URL: https://broadsign.com/inventory-catalog/

### Launch a Programmatic DOOH Campaign
Broadsign helps media buyers launch and optimize programmatic DOOH campaigns globally. Users can target audiences using their preferred DSP or the dedicated OutMoove DSP across 1.7+ million premium digital screens.
URL: https://broadsign.com/launch-pdooh-campaign/

### Measurement & Attribution
Broadsign partners with data providers to track digital out-of-home ad performance. Marketers can measure brand lift, foot traffic, online engagement, and point-of-sale data to calculate accurate campaign ROI.
URL: https://broadsign.com/measurement-attribution/

